2) Information Architecture & Routes
	•	GET /login → existing/new.
	•	GET /onboarding/welcome → timed welcome (new only).
	•	GET /onboarding/create-class → Step 1 (new only subpath 1).
	•	GET /onboarding/create-assignment → Step 2 wizard (6 steps).
	•	GET /onboarding/plan-upsell → plan dialog/screen.
	•	GET /onboarding/student-creation → (Gold or School Usage, subpath 2).
	•	GET /dashboard (Home) → class overview.
	•	GET /classes/:classId → class detail (year range, assignments list).
	•	GET /classes/:classId/assignments/new → 6-step wizard (same as onboarding step 2).
	•	GET /assignments/:assignmentId → assignment detail.
	•	GET /students → student creation/management.
	•	GET /profile → profile/settings + plan card.

Global 404/500, auth guard, and plan guard.

