10) Student Creation/Management

Route: /students

Header: “Students” + class selector (students-class-select).

Actions Bar: add-student, bulk-import, bulk-delete (guarded by confirm), Search (students-search).

Roster Table (students-table): inline editable like a spreadsheet.
	•	Columns: Checkbox (students-row-check), Name, Email, Student ID, Status, Last Active.
	•	Row menu: Edit, Delete.
	•	Inline save on blur; Undo toast within 5s.

Alt Enroll (Gold/School): “Show QR” (students-qr) to let students self-enroll.

