12) Onboarding Flows

Main Path 1 – New Login
	•	Subpath 1 (No Payment):
	1.	/onboarding/welcome – timed 2.5s warm welcome. continue auto-advance or skip.
	2.	/onboarding/create-class – required: Class Name, optional Description.
	3.	/onboarding/create-assignment – 6-step wizard (see §8).
	4.	/onboarding/plan-upsell – Dialog shows plan matrix and limits with CTA Bronze $10, Silver $20, Gold $40; or I’m good (plan-good). Selecting a plan → /payment (external or embedded). After payment:
	•	If Gold → Subpath 2.
	•	Else → /dashboard.
	•	Subpath 2 (Gold chosen) → /onboarding/student-creation:
	•	Step: Select Class (onb-students-class-select).
	•	Choice: Enroll Manually (onb-students-manual) or QR Enroll (onb-students-qr).
	•	After roster setup → /dashboard with first-time guided tour.

First-time Guided Tour: floating arrows + hotspots (max 6): Home, Add Class, Add Assignment, Students, Assignment Detail actions, Profile. Persist tourCompleted=true then route to Main Path 2.

Main Path 2 – Existing Users
	•	Direct to /dashboard. All behaviors per plan guards.

