17) Key API Contracts (pseudo)
	•	GET /api/classes → Class[]
	•	POST /api/classes → Class
	•	GET /api/classes/:id → Class
	•	GET /api/classes/:id/assignments → Assignment[]
	•	POST /api/classes/:id/assignments → Assignment
	•	GET /api/assignments/:id → Assignment
	•	GET /api/assignments/:id/submissions → Submission[]
	•	POST /api/assignments/:id/grade-all?scope=recent|year|all|past|present
	•	POST /api/submissions/:id/grade
	•	GET /api/submissions/:id/download (paper)
	•	GET /api/submissions/:id/grade-output (feedback)
	•	GET /api/students?classId=... → Student[]
	•	POST /api/students | PATCH /api/students/:id | DELETE /api/students/:id
	•	GET /api/me → User
	•	PATCH /api/me (toggle cuttingEdgeAI)

Plan Guard Header: backend returns X-Feature-Allowed: true|false and remaining quota; front-end renders Gate if false.

