22) Edge Cases
	•	Year spans: If yearStart missing, show “Year not set” link to edit.
	•	Rubric parse fail: fall back to raw text in rubric-editor + toast.
	•	Quota exceeded: Disable action, show Gate with counters.
	•	Downgrade from Gold: Hide student-side; retain data but mark read-only until re-upgrade.

