23) Agent-Executable Test Plan (Gherkin)

Feature: Existing teacher goes to dashboard
  Scenario: Main Path 2 navigation
    Given I am an authenticated user on plan "silver"
    When I visit "/dashboard"
    Then I should see an element with testid "add-class"
    And I should see at least 1 element with testid "class-card"

Feature: Create assignment from class detail
  Scenario: Wizard completion
    Given I click testid "add-assignment"
    When I fill "step1-title" with "Essay 1"
    And I fill "step2-details" with "Write about ecosystems"
    And I upload to "rubric-upload" a file "rubric.pdf"
    And I check "big-ideas" and "grammar" and "analysis-depth"
    And I click grade level "10"
    And I select grading style "normal"
    And I click "wizard-next" until finish
    Then I should land on the class detail with a card titled "Essay 1"

Feature: Assignment actions
  Scenario: Grade all recent
    Given I am on "/assignments/123"
    When I click "btn-grade-all"
    And I set "grade-all-filter" to "recent"
    Then a grading job should start and a toast appears

Feature: Plan guard
  Scenario: Free plan tries students page
    Given my plan is "free"
    When I navigate to "/students"
    Then I see a Plan Gate dialog with Upgrade CTA "plan-upgrade"


