24) Acceptance Checklist (Ship-Ready)
	•	All routes load with skeleton states.
	•	Dashboard shows correct class metrics & colorized averages.
	•	Class detail shows year range & assignment cards.
	•	Wizard validates required fields, auto-saves, supports rubric upload + edit.
	•	Assignment detail displays metrics and three primary buttons with filters.
	•	Submissions view supports checkbox selection, origin logo, completion icons, grade colors, and 3-dot menu actions.
	•	Students page behaves like inline-edit roster; supports QR for Gold/School.
	•	Profile shows avatar, plan status, upgrade/toggles, and counters.
	•	Plan guard appears for restricted features and when quotas are exceeded.
	•	Guided tour displays only once and stores completion.
	•	data-testid attributes match this spec exactly.
	•	All controls have aria-labels and keyboard navigation.

