25) Visual Notes (Liquid Glass)
	•	Panels: frosted glass containers with subtle inner highlight and soft shadow.
	•	Hover: slight lift (translateY -2px) + blur increase.
	•	Focus: glow ring; reduce blur for clarity.
	•	Cards: icon + title row; metric chips right aligned; action affordances minimal until hover.

